PROVENANCE

The method implemented here is from the NDSS 2017 paper:

  MaMaDroid: Detecting Android Malware by Building Markov Chains of Behavioral
  Models. Mariano Graziano, Davide Canali, Leyla Bilge, Ashwin Rao,
  Davide Balzarotti. NDSS 2017.

This repository is a maintained fork of the code released alongside that paper.
